      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Survival, plasma HIV-1 RNA concentrations and drug resistance\nin HIV-1-infected Haitian adolescents and young adults on\nantiretrovirals\n\nMacarthur Charles,? Francine Noel,* Paul Leger,? Patrice Severe,* Cynthia Riviere,? Carole Anne Beauharnais,*\nErica Miller,° John Rutledge,° Heejung Bang,” Wesley Shealey,° Richard T D’Aquila,° Roy M Gulick,°\nWarren D Johnson Jr,” Peter F Wright,° Jean William Pape? & Daniel W Fitzgerald?\n\nObjective To assess outcomes after antiretroviral therapy (ART) in adolescents and youth in Haiti, a country with a generalized\nepidemic of infection with HIV-1.\n\nMethods A",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The opening page and abstract of a 2008 Bulletin study of survival, plasma HIV-1 RNA levels and drug resistance in Haitians aged 13–25 years starting antiretroviral therapy for AIDS at a Port-au-Prince clinic between 2003 and 2005. It sets out the objective, methods, main findings and author and submission details.",
